digraph SQ { graph[rankdir=TB, bgcolor="white",fontname="DejaVu Sans",label="SEQUENCE: DAT HANG (tom tat luong)",fontsize=17, ranksep=.45];node [shape=box,style="rounded,filled",fontname="DejaVu Sans",fontsize=11,fillcolor="#eef5ff"];edge[color="#6e849e",arrowsize=.65]; a [label="1. Khách -> CheckoutController\nPOST /checkout"]; b [label="2. Controller -> OrderService\nplace(form, cart) @Transactional"]; c [label="3. Service -> ProductDao\nfindById + decreaseStock WHERE stock >= quantity"]; d [label="4. Service -> OrderDao\ninsertOrder + insertItem"]; e [label="5. MySQL\nCOMMIT hoặc ROLLBACK khi lỗi"]; f [label="6. Controller -> Khách\nTrang xác nhận / Thông báo lỗi"];a->b->c->d->e->f}